4], "label": "seed", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "seed"}], "size": [270, 90], "pos": [1477.1500244140625, 1104.7086181640625], "widgets_values": [577411505905400, "randomize"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "seed"}, "name": "seed", "label": "seed", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "seed"}], "flags": {}, "id": 52, "type": "SeedNode", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.31.0", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "SeedNode"}, "order": 3}, {"mode": 0, "showAdvanced": true, "outputs": [{"name": "CONDITIONING", "links": [65, 68], "label": "CONDITIONING", "type": "CONDITIONING", "localized_name": "CONDITIONING"}, {"name": "seconds", "links": [66], "label": "seconds", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "seconds"}], "size": [472.5835876464844, 539.236328125], "pos": [1850.0927734375, 607.8363037109375], "widgets_values": ["Traditional Chinese-inspired lyrical song, strong ancient Chinese aesthetic, intimate and poetic female vocal, restrained and natural singing, pentatonic melodic language, modal Chinese melody, free-flowing phrasing, elegant and melancholic atmosphere.\n\nPipa as the main rhythmic and melodic instrument, guzheng answering phrases, xiao flute carrying long breathy melodic lines, subtle erhu textures, sparse ruan and traditional Chinese percussion. Minimal Western instrumentation, no dominant piano, no pop string pads, no drum kit.\n\nSparse acoustic arrangement, spacious pauses, delicate ornamentation, traditional Chinese instrumental interplay, melody-led rather than chord-led harmony. Avoid standard Western pop chord progressions.\n\nRainy ancient town at night, stone alleys, lantern reflections, mist, distant bells, quiet sorrow, classical Chinese poetry atmosphere.\n\nShort atmospheric instrumental opening, storytelling vocal sections, gradual emotional development without a big pop chorus, restrained climax, instrumental interludes led by pipa and xiao, lingering instrumental outro.\n\nAuthentic Chinese acoustic timbres, natural room ambience, subtle spacious reverb, cinematic only in atmosphere rather than orchestration.\n\nNo EDM, no synth-pop, no pop-rock drums, no big power-ballad chorus, no glossy commercial pop production, no excessive Western orchestral strings, no excessive opera-style singing, no artist imitation.", "[Intro]\n城门鼓歇 雨落无声\n我在旧约里等一个人\n\n[Verse 1]\n我从霸桥折柳启程\n一路问过几处驿门\n你说上元灯火将明\n便在朱雀街头相认\n我把青色旧伞撑开\n站过午后又站到黄昏\n卖花人收起最后一枝春\n仍不见你穿过人群\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\n雨打湿袖口的字\n那封信还握在掌心\n\n[Chorus]\n长安落雨不逢君\n我把一生等成一城黄昏\n灯火照过千万张脸\n没有一张是旧时故人\n长安落雨不逢君\n风把约定吹过十二城门\n若你也曾向这里赶来\n为何我们错在同一个时辰\n\n[Verse 2]\n客栈掌灯问我姓名\n我只说等一场雨停\n窗外马蹄来来又去\n每一声都像你的回音\n后来听闻北去的路\n去年冬天封了数旬\n我忽然不敢再追问\n怕答案比等待更冷\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\n纸上墨痕已经晕开\n你的名字仍旧分明\n\n[Chorus]\n长安落雨不逢君\n我把一生等成一城黄昏\n灯火照过千万张脸\n没有一张是旧时故人\n长安落雨不逢君\n风把约定吹过十二城门\n若你也曾向这里赶来\n为何我们错在同一个时辰\n\n[Bridge]\n多年以后又过长安\n旧街已经换了行人\n有人在檐下借我一把伞\n像你当年说话的声音\n\n[Final Chorus]\n长安又雨仍不逢君\n我终于不再追问那年缘分\n把没有寄出的信放入水中\n看它越过桥下的年轮\n长安落雨不必逢君\n有些约定只负责照亮一程\n我转身走进万家灯火\n从此也做自己的归人", 222, "fixed", 240.00000000000006, 1.7, 50], "inputs": [{"name": "clip", "link": 64, "label": "clip", "type": "CLIP", "localized_name": "clip"}, {"widget": {"name": "caption"}, "name": "caption", "link": 84, "label": "caption", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "caption"}, {"widget": {"name": "lyrics"}, "name": "lyrics", "link": 82, "label": "lyrics", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "lyrics"}, {"widget": {"name": "seed"}, "name": "seed", "link": 73, "label": "seed", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "seed"}, {"widget": {"name": "max_duration"}, "name": "max_duration", "link": 85, "label": "max_duration", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "max_duration"}, {"widget": {"name": "cfg_scale"}, "name": "cfg_scale", "label": "cfg_scale", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "cfg_scale"}, {"widget": {"name": "top_k"}, "name": "top_k", "label": "top_k", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "top_k"}], "flags": {}, "id": 45, "type": "MiniMaxMusic3TextEncode", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.31.0", "widget_ue_con